Package: thermal
Title: Correct thermal infrared images acquired by drones
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Marc-André", "Lemay", , "marc-andre.lemay@uqat.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package provides software for processing thermal infrared images
             acquired using drones with specific focus on how thermal drift can be
	     corrected through data post-processing. Methods for correcting drift
	     based on linear models, splines, and image overlap are provided. Experimental
	     methods for correcting vignetting are also included.
